  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When wearing no armor, not carrying a shield, and unencumbered, the envoy adds his Charisma modifier (if any) to his AC and CMD. These bonuses increase by +1 for every 4 envoy levels possessed. This AC bonus does not stack with similar class features or other ways to add an additional ability score to the envoy’s AC; if he has more than one such ability, he uses the highest extra ability score modifier.</p>\n<p>This bonus to AC applies even against touch attacks or when the envoy is flat-footed. He loses these bonuses when he is immobilized or helpless, when he wears any armor, uses a shield, or when he carries a medium or heavy load.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/envoy#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
